#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:85
#: 82d4f21556fe4c66a2aaee872db4b314
msgid ""
"Robot-side VR insertion is separate: set `enable_vr: true` in the "
"description’s `config/ocs2/target_manager.yaml` (most robots default "
"off). Same file: `vr_update_rate`, `vr_follow_frame`. Button map and "
"follow-frame troubleshooting: [VR Teleop How-"
"To](../../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md)."
msgstr ""
"机器人侧的 VR 接入是另一处：在描述包 `config/ocs2/target_manager.yaml` 中设置 "
"`enable_vr: true`（多数机型默认关闭）。同一文件还有 `vr_update_rate`、"
"`vr_follow_frame`。按键表与跟随坐标系排查见 [VR 遥操作](../../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:87
#: dbe5718bfc8240eba4921eb0ee2ee91e
msgid "Network Setup"
msgstr "网络设置"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:89
#: 38f043b0960c4278b7881d2f34ba3d6d
msgid ""
"**Pico Enterprise:** USB shared networking (USB 网络共享) can put the headset"
" and PC on one network. Use the headset UI; no ADB steps here."
msgstr "**Pico 企业版：** USB 网络共享可将头显与电脑放在同一网络。使用头显界面；此处不写 ADB 步骤。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:90
#: e30e3a7f25bc4e96b324fa89899bd2ba
msgid "**Pico consumer / Quest:** Wi-Fi (or other IP) only for this doc."
msgstr "**Pico 消费版 / Quest：** 本文仅记录 Wi-Fi（或其他 IP）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:92
#: 04d67705434a49138a5df9987e5dc753
msgid ""
"If the VR device is on a different network: Zenoh or DDS discovery, "
"firewall, matching Domain IDs."
msgstr "若 VR 设备在不同网络：使用 Zenoh 或 DDS 发现、防火墙、匹配的 Domain ID。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:94
#: ade5a2c0ce174299b84862e6b7b07a1a
msgid "Certificates"
msgstr "证书"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:96
#: 0111902243b34380b641c292e836ae34
msgid "Security Note"
msgstr "安全说明"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:99
#: a8b75a787dd94249a14c90fc871a1ac4
msgid ""
"WebXR requires HTTPS. Certificates are user-generated and should not be "
"committed to version control."
msgstr "WebXR 需要 HTTPS。证书由用户自行生成，不应提交到版本控制。"

